@base = http://localhost:8100

### Catálogo (módulo catalog)
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/products

### Stock (módulo inventory)
GET {{base}}/api/inventory/stock

### Comprar: catálogo → inventario → pagos → pedido, en UNA transacción
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "ana", "items": [{"sku": "INV-004", "quantity": 2}, {"sku": "INV-001", "quantity": 1}]}

### Pago rechazado (600 > 500): rollback, el stock de INV-003 no cambia
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "beto", "items": [{"sku": "INV-003", "quantity": 5}]}

### Sin stock → 409
POST {{base}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId": "ana", "items": [{"sku": "INV-002", "quantity": 1}]}

### Pagos (módulo payments)
GET {{base}}/api/payments

### Envíos (módulo shipping, reacciona a OrderPlaced)
GET {{base}}/api/shipments

### Pedidos
GET {{base}}/api/orders
